    <item>
      <title>Cloud-init</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/cloud-init/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 11 Nov 2024 14:32:05 -0800</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/cloud-init/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Configuring a new virtual machine is never really a big deal until you have to deal with provisioning more than one, which becomes a time-sink. Thankfully we have the ability to configure a good baseline with cloud-init.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;ubuntu-2404-lts&#34;&gt;Ubuntu 24.04 LTS&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;vmware-vcenter-8&#34;&gt;VMware vCenter 8&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;proxmox&#34;&gt;Proxmox&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Yes, we know how to do this - put the information here then.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;lxd-canonical-virtualizor&#34;&gt;LXD (Canonical virtualizor)&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Haven&amp;rsquo;t done this yet, need to do this.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
